  "bodyHash": "9e9e486550cfc339",
  "content": "\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_daa9b448-da61-461f-be4e-60a7d04ea9a9.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Mine Counter Strike，再次闪耀</span></strong></em></h1>\n<hr>\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">注意：<br>本模组是<strong>Timeless and Classics:Zero 扩展包</strong>的<strong>自动安装版本</strong>：<br>**MCS2 枪械包模组**。<br><br>若未安装<strong>Timeless and Classics:Zero</strong>或<strong>LR Tactical</strong>模组，<strong>本模组在游戏中将不会显示任何内容</strong>。<br><strong>武器包下载链接：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-mcs2-gunpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MCS2 扩展包</a><br></span></h2>\n<p>本枪械包仍在开发中，目前该包内共有<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">5</span>把枪械，分别是</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>M4A1-S</strong></span>、<strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">USP-S</span></strong>、<strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">AK47</span></strong>、<strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">Glock-18</span></strong>、<span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>AWP</strong></span></p>\n<h2><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">[重要！]</span> </span>安装方法：</span></strong></h2>\n<p><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>适用于 TaCZ：</strong></span></p>\n<p>将 .jar 文件放入 .<strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">minecraft\\mods</span></strong>&nbsp;文件夹中，然后启动游戏客户端</p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>特性</strong></span></h1>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1113043/description_ad510f24-55c2-4a89-992a-5232d8d15f23.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>M4A1-S</em></h1>\n<p><em>与无消音器版本相比，M4A1-S 的弹匣更小，但发射时更加安静，后坐力更低且精度更高。</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1113043/description_216c3d1e-2da5-4274-94a5-1fe501d4ef34.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1113043/description_ffceaf3d-79c3-4da7-8baa-90ebe077127c.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>USP-S</em></h1>\n<p><em>源自《反恐精英：起源》的人气之作，USP-S 消音版配备可拆卸消音器，在抑制枪声的同时减少后坐力。</em></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1113043/description_3ce3a4ae-ff5f-4c57-b45a-46e074dd9eec.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"315\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1113043/description_410a0ccf-0743-40bd-8e99-513ba771c10f.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>AK-47</em></h1>\n<p><em>威力强大且可靠耐用，AK-47 是世界上最受欢迎的突击步枪之一。在短点射中它能发挥最大的杀伤力。</em></p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1113043/description_c9f2feea-ecbc-46fc-a971-b50eec427aad.png\" alt=\"\"></em></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1113043/description_a4eb6272-932b-418b-b6a5-26e0854403f1.png\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>Glock-18</em></h1>\n<p><em>Glock 18 是一把实用型首发手枪，对无甲目标效果最佳，并且具备三连发能力。</em></p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1113043/description_3494198e-d669-45de-95c7-2d5df8cb9d25.png\" alt=\"\"></em></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1113043/description_d76ae546-3e15-4d04-98b3-541ade1ccda6.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><em>AWP</em></h1>\n<p><em>高风险高回报，臭名昭著的 AWP 以其标志性的枪声和“一枪一杀”的致命法则而闻名。</em></p>\n<p><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1113043/description_8d858cb2-3e0e-4f10-9b5c-0f2e7d7922c9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"449\"></em></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
